udent duties, unlike her childhood friend Riho. Although more mature than most girls of her age, Ayame is quite childish, ecstatic about food or losing herself in supermarkets..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents are long-time friends of the Tachibanaki family as well as being their neighbours. So she became quite naturally friends with Riho and Keisuke very early in their childhood. Due to their work, her parents will have to leave for a few months to settle in London. Following this transfer, Ayame decided to..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68615"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染み。学園の３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から主人公にほのかな恋心を抱いてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心根の優しい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事もがんばり屋さんな性格で、とくに主人公のことでは一生懸命になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時にそのがんばりが空回りすることも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19755","sourceWorkId":"26610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染み。学園の３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から主人公にほのかな恋心を抱いてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心根の優しい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事もがんばり屋さんな性格で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とくに主人公のことでは一生懸命になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時にそのがんばりが空回りすることも"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61537"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19755","sourceWorkId":"26610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19755","sourceWorkId":"26610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19755","sourceWorkId":"26610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19755","sourceWorkId":"26610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3